    "summary": "Errata to the Effect of the Covenite Coterie [Postmortality](vsdata:ability/drukhari.covenite-coterie.postmortality) Stratagem:\n\n1. Spend 1 to 3 Pain tokens.\n2. As the phase ends, set the **destroyed** model back up **unengaged**, as near as it can be to the spot where it was destroyed.\n3. It has as many wounds left as the Pain tokens you spent.\n\nIts unit's **starting strength** is 1, and the model never belongs to an **attached** unit.",
